## Workflow
The `/devflow` driver runs the whole pipeline in one interactive session:

- `/devflow` — Jira standup → pick a task → route → run the phase.
- `/devflow <slug>` — skip standup, resume at the phase the artifacts imply.

It spawns a phase agent, shows the artifact, and waits for your approval at the gate before the next phase:

1. `research` agent → `vault/research/<slug>.md`   (gate)
2. `plan` agent → `vault/plans/<slug>.md`   (gate)
3. `implement` agent → `vault/changelog/<date>-<slug>.md`   (autonomous)

Vault layout: `tz/` `research/` `plans/` `changelog/` `notes/`

## Notes
Use `/note save <title>` during work to persist patterns/rules to `notes/`.
Use `/note search <query>` to search the vault.
